 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "INTRODUCTION"
 },
 {
  "type": "end",
  "name": "Subtitle"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "h3",
  "style": "h3",
  "html": "<strong>Anti-corrosion Mechanism</strong>"
 },
 {
  "type": "end",
  "name": "Title"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "Immerse the derusted anchor bar and accessories in liquid zinc for a certain time, so that the atoms can penetrate and diffuse each other, thereby forming an iron-zinc alloy layer, which is dense, uniform, firmly bonded, bright and corrosion resistant."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "Zinc is an amphoteric metal. In thermodynamics, zinc has a stable area. Hot-dip galvanizing is an electrochemical anti-corrosion method, which hinder further corrosion through insoluble chemical substances produced by interaction between zinc and concrete solution.<strong><br></strong><br>"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "h3",
  "style": "h3",
  "html": "<strong>Product Standard</strong>"
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "Sinorock has formulated the standard for galvanized products coatings in accordance with ISO 1461 \" Hot dip galvanized coatings on fabricated iron and steel articles — Specifications and test methods\". The coating thickness of main products is as follows:<strong><br></strong><br>"
 },
 {
  "type": "embed",
  "html": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700&display=swap');\n  .ct-root { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; background: #F1EFEA; color: #1a1a18; padding: 32px 28px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .ct-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .ct-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #e8620a; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }\n  .ct-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; fill: #fff; }\n  .ct-title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1a1a18; }\n  .ct-note { font-size: 11px; color: #888; font-style: italic; margin-top: 6px; padding: 6px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #e8620a; background: rgba(232,98,10,0.06); }\n  .ct-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12.5px; }\n  .ct-table thead tr { background: #2a2a26; color: #fff; }\n  .ct-table thead th { padding: 7px 10px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }\n  .ct-table thead th:first-child { text-align: left; }\n  .ct-table tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd9d0; transition: background 0.1s; }\n  .ct-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #ede9e2; }\n  .ct-table tbody tr:hover { background: #fde8d6; }\n  .ct-table tbody td { padding: 7px 10px; text-align: center; color: #333; }\n  .ct-table tbody td:first-child { text-align: left; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1a18; }\n</style><div class=\"ct-root\"><div class=\"ct-header\"><div class=\"ct-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"15\" width=\"20\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"11\" width=\"20\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1\" opacity=\".6\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1\" opacity=\".3\"></rect></svg></div><span class=\"ct-title\">Product Standard — Coating Thickness (ISO 1461)</span></div><table class=\"ct-table\"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Mean Coating Thickness min. (μm)</th><th>Local Coating Thickness min. (μm)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hollow Anchor Bar</td><td>85</td><td>70</td></tr><tr><td>Coupler</td><td>55</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td>Nut</td><td>55</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td>Plate</td><td>85</td><td>70</td></tr><tr><td>Centralizer</td><td>55</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><td>Wedge</td><td>55</td><td>45</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"ct-note\">Note: This table is for general use, and we can also meet customers' special requirements.</div></div>"
 },
 {
  "type": "end",
  "name": "Page Title"
 },
 {
  "type": "end",
  "name": "Inner"
 },
